{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "cues": [
    {
      "id": "craft-escape-cue-1",
      "transcript": "In 1848, Ellen and William Craft escaped slavery by traveling openly.",
      "file": "audio/craft-escape/narration/cue-1.wav",
      "start": 0,
      "duration": 5.825,
      "beatIndex": 0,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "craft-escape.asset.open-escape.script.1",
      "samples": 139800,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "craft-escape-cue-2",
      "transcript": "Ellen posed as a white male slaveholder. Her husband, William, posed as her enslaved servant.",
      "file": "audio/craft-escape/narration/cue-2.wav",
      "start": 6.033333333333333,
      "duration": 6.875,
      "beatIndex": 1,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "craft-escape.asset.open-escape.script.2",
      "samples": 165000,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "craft-escape-cue-3",
      "transcript": "But that identity created a dangerous problem. A gentleman might be asked to sign his name. Ellen could not write.",
      "file": "audio/craft-escape/narration/cue-3.wav",
      "start": 13.3,
      "duration": 7.525,
      "beatIndex": 2,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "craft-escape.asset.open-escape.script.3",
      "samples": 180600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "craft-escape-cue-4",
      "transcript": "So she bound her right hand, making it appear injured. A report published weeks after their escape describes her avoiding signatures this way.",
      "file": "audio/craft-escape/narration/cue-4.wav",
      "start": 21.033333333333335,
      "duration": 8.925,
      "beatIndex": 3,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "craft-escape.asset.open-escape.script.4",
      "samples": 214200,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "craft-escape-cue-5",
      "transcript": "Their later book explains more: bandages hid her beardless chin, spectacles obscured her face, and apparent illness gave her a reason to avoid conversation.",
      "file": "audio/craft-escape/narration/cue-5.wav",
      "start": 30.333333333333332,
      "duration": 10.6,
      "beatIndex": 4,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "craft-escape.asset.open-escape.script.5",
      "samples": 254400,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "craft-escape-cue-6",
      "transcript": "William helped sustain the performance, acting as her attendant. Together, they traveled north by train and steamer.",
      "file": "audio/craft-escape/narration/cue-6.wav",
      "start": 41.13333333333333,
      "duration": 7.475,
      "beatIndex": 5,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "craft-escape.asset.open-escape.script.6",
      "samples": 179400,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "craft-escape-cue-7",
      "transcript": "But before Philadelphia, they faced a test the disguise could not answer.",
      "file": "audio/craft-escape/narration/cue-7.wav",
      "start": 48.833333333333336,
      "duration": 4.8,
      "beatIndex": 6,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "craft-escape.asset.open-escape.script.7",
      "samples": 115200,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "craft-escape-cue-8",
      "transcript": "In their account, officials in Baltimore demanded assurance that the supposed master had the right to take William along.",
      "file": "audio/craft-escape/narration/cue-8.wav",
      "start": 53.833333333333336,
      "duration": 7.85,
      "beatIndex": 7,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "craft-escape.asset.open-escape.script.8",
      "samples": 188400,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "craft-escape-cue-9",
      "transcript": "Looking like a slaveholder was not proof of ownership.",
      "file": "audio/craft-escape/narration/cue-9.wav",
      "start": 61.9,
      "duration": 3.55,
      "beatIndex": 8,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "craft-escape.asset.open-escape.script.9",
      "samples": 85200,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "craft-escape-cue-10",
      "transcript": "William’s account says a conductor confirmed they had arrived on his train. With departure approaching, the officer allowed them through, citing the apparent master’s illness.",
      "file": "audio/craft-escape/narration/cue-10.wav",
      "start": 65.83333333333333,
      "duration": 10.65,
      "beatIndex": 9,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "craft-escape.asset.open-escape.script.10",
      "samples": 255600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "craft-escape-cue-11",
      "transcript": "They reached Philadelphia after four days. Yet escape did not mean lasting safety.",
      "file": "audio/craft-escape/narration/cue-11.wav",
      "start": 76.7,
      "duration": 5.5,
      "beatIndex": 10,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "craft-escape.asset.open-escape.script.11",
      "samples": 132000,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "craft-escape-cue-12",
      "transcript": "In 1850, men came to Boston to recapture them. The Crafts subsequently left for England.",
      "file": "audio/craft-escape/narration/cue-12.wav",
      "start": 82.56666666666666,
      "duration": 6.55,
      "beatIndex": 11,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "craft-escape.asset.open-escape.script.12",
      "samples": 157200,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "craft-escape-cue-13",
      "transcript": "Their plan exploited the treatment given to a supposed white gentleman. But every accommodation depended on keeping that false identity intact.",
      "file": "audio/craft-escape/narration/cue-13.wav",
      "start": 89.33333333333333,
      "duration": 9.325,
      "beatIndex": 12,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "craft-escape.asset.open-escape.script.13",
      "samples": 223800,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "craft-escape-cue-14",
      "transcript": "They escaped a system that treated them as property, by making it appear that one owned the other.",
      "file": "audio/craft-escape/narration/cue-14.wav",
      "start": 98.86666666666666,
      "duration": 5.7,
      "beatIndex": 13,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "craft-escape.asset.open-escape.script.14",
      "samples": 136800,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    }
  ],
